        "slideId": "s10",
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Once character spans are aligned to tokens, sequence models represent entities using discrete token tagging schemes. Two standards predominate: IOB2, also called BIO, and BIOES, also known as BILOU.",
