        "slideId": "s14",
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Resilient infrastructure protects curated gold datasets against ransomware encryption, accidental bucket deletion, and regional cloud outages through the classic three-two-one backup rule: maintain three independent copies of business-critical data across at least two distinct storage media types, with at least one immutable air-gapped replica in a separate geographic region.",
