        "text": "That is the core dilemma of modern AI ethics, Kaito! Think about Kleinberg's Impossibility Theorem and Bayes' rule. How does the base rate difference between populations dictate the relationship between precision and false positives? Select Option A, B, or C above us!",
        "start": 632.064,
